# Shell scripts must keep LF endings. This repo is developed on Windows but
# syn/gt2n/*.sh and tb/*.sh are run on Linux (see docs/HANDOFF_2NM_LINUX.md);
# a CRLF shebang fails there with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M",
# which is a confusing error for a file that looks perfectly fine.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Tcl and yosys scripts are consumed by the same Linux-side flows.
*.tcl text eol=lf
*.ys  text eol=lf
